  "label": "Concept of Eternal Punishment",
  "description": "The idea that non-believers in God will suffer and burn for all eternity in hell is a theological doctrine primarily associated with certain Christian denominations, particularly those with Calvinist or fundamentalist leanings. This concept is not universally accepted across all religions or belief systems and is often used as a moral or doctrinal tool to encourage belief in God. Its inclusion in the meme is meant to shock or provoke by juxtaposing it with an unrelated and equally extreme statement about child abuse.",
